OL,3,GNEWSAFire forces residents from block
OL,4,Aof flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a block flats have
OL,7,Fbeen forced to leave their homes in the
OL,8,Fearly hours after a fire broke out.
OL,10,FCrews were called to Sarnia Court in
OL,11,FSouthampton at about 03:00 GMT after
OL,12,Freports of smoke and alarms sounding in
OL,13,Fthe block.
OL,15,FHampshire fire service said the fire,
OL,16,Ffound in a cavity wall, had been
OL,17,Ftackled by crews who were continuing to
OL,18,Fdamp down hotspots.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
