OL,3,GNEWSAFire forces residents from block
OL,4,Aof flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt added that there were no reports of
OL,7,Finjuries and it was supporting
OL,8,Fresidents with Southampton City
OL,9,FCouncil. People are being urged to
OL,10,Favoid the area around Boniface
OL,11,FCrescent.
